sequenceDiagram
    participant ChatCtrl as Chat Controller
    participant LLM as LLM Service
    participant Orch as Orchestrator Service
    participant ToolRepo as ToolCall Repository
    participant MsgRepo as Message Repository
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ

    ChatCtrl->>LLM: generate with tool schema
    LLM-->>ChatCtrl: toolCall(name,args)
    ChatCtrl->>Orch: executeTool(toolCall)
    Orch->>ToolRepo: save(request PENDING)
    ToolRepo->>PG: INSERT tool_calls

    Orch-->>ChatCtrl: toolResult
    ChatCtrl->>ToolRepo: update(result SUCCESS)
    ToolRepo->>PG: UPDATE tool_calls
    ChatCtrl->>MsgRepo: append assistant message (tool result summarized)
    MsgRepo->>PG: INSERT messages
    Orch-->>MQ: publish simulation.tool.completed
